-- checked-arithmetic-example-is-sanitizer-clean/record --
replaces codegen/c/checked_arith_test.go TestCheckedArithmeticExampleIsSanitizerClean/-O0
replaces codegen/c/checked_arith_test.go TestCheckedArithmeticExampleIsSanitizerClean/-O1
strict-libs the test compiles its build's C with -std=c11 -Wall -Wextra -Werror -fstrict-flex-arrays=3 at its level and flags itself, which the driver's -w turns off; the runner compiles it so
